15
00:01:09.881 --> 00:01:15.001
The student sits at the centre of these
intersecting partnerships. Families,

16
00:01:15.002 --> 00:01:19.711
school staff and support staff bring
different knowledge and different

17
00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:25.242
relationships with that young person. In
secondary school there may be six or more

18
00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:30.021
