or what helped in an earlier

23
00:01:50.914 --> 00:01:55.897
setting. The student knows things an
outside observer cannot tell us: what

24
00:01:55.898 --> 00:02:01.359
something feels like, what helps and what
is hard. What should these partnerships

25
00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:06.547
make possible for the student? Hold
access, participation and their own goals

26
00:02:06.548 --> 00:02:11.327
in view. Ask who is missing from the
conversation and how the student's

27
00:02:11.328 --> 00:02:16.379
communication can be included. Page
nineteen of your guide brings these key

28
00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.402
