60
00:04:58.041 --> 00:05:03.198
We're going to hear from Adon. As you
watch, pay attention to what decisions

61
00:05:03.199 --> 00:05:08.631
were made, who made them, and the impact
those decisions had on him. Let his own

62
00:05:08.632 --> 00:05:10.625
