be to bring the question to that team.

169
00:15:55.944 --> 00:16:00.964
Keep the plan open to what students and
families tell you once the change is in

170
00:16:00.965 --> 00:16:01.220
use.

171
00:16:02.721 --> 00:16:07.668
Now use page twenty-three to plan one real
conversation you will have within

172
00:16:07.669 --> 00:16:12.880
two weeks. Choose a student's family, the
student themselves, or a colleague who

173
00:16:12.881 --> 00:16:18.092
