176
00:16:27.791 --> 00:16:32.804
Write what you will share, beginning with
a strength. Write what you will ask

177
00:16:32.805 --> 00:16:37.753
specifically, and what you can offer. Then
write your opening sentence, word

178
00:16:37.754 --> 00:16:42.701
for word. Add when, where and how the
conversation could happen. Include the

179
00:16:42.702 --> 00:16:47.517
process change you identified earlier. How
will the person's communication

180
00:16:47.518 --> 00:16:52.729
preferences be supported? How will the
student's voice be included, even if this

181
00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:57.545
is a conversation between staff? What will
happen afterwards, and who will

182
00:16:57.546 --> 00:17:02.691
